# Production / Monetization

- **Effective access = plan ∩ role** (never union). Source: `backend/app/services/entitlements.py`.
- Auth: session Bearer or `X-API-Key`; Postgres when `USE_DB_AUTH` / `USE_POSTGRES_AUTH`.
- Guest: tracker read; dossier cap (15) then paywall modal. No desk writes, chat, or labeling.
- B2C paywall/billing only when counsel-approved (`INTELLENS_RETAIL_MARKETING` or `sebi_retail` attest).
- Legal: `POST /api/legal/attest` · `GET /api/legal/meta` · Terms/Privacy acceptance on register.
- Do not fake production SSO — OIDC is per-org ops follow-up; keep stubs honest.
- Secrets via env (`INTELLENS_*`); run `scripts/check-production-secrets.sh` before prod deploy.
- KB: `docs/kb/09-i18n-auth-markets.md`, `docs/kb/13-commercial.md`, `docs/PRODUCTION_B2B_B2C.md`.
